# This fork keeps its own README. The "ours" merge driver makes a merge from
# upstream leave it untouched instead of raising a conflict on every sync.
#
# The driver itself is a local setting and does not travel with a clone, so on
# a fresh checkout run this once or the merge falls back to a normal conflict:
#
#     git config merge.ours.driver true
#
README.md merge=ours
